            %h6#remark Remark
            %p
              The implicit idea in
              %a{:href => "#ConnerFloyd66"} Conner-Floyd 66, p. 99
              must be to see
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
