              under a version of the
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Pontrjagin-Thom+construction"} Pontrjagin-Thom construction
              = succeed "." do
                %a{:href => "#ConnerFloyd66"} p. 97
              %em define
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo ∂
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \partial
              in this geometric way, but then the claim wrapping around p. 100-101 needs proof. This claim however is immediate from the abstract homotopy theory, namely it is just the continuation yet one step further along the long cofiber sequence – this is Prop.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#AShortExactSequenceOfUFrBordismRings"}
              below.
          %p
