                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} {\color{magenta}M^{2d}} \in \pi_{2d}\big( M(U,fr) \big)
              is a lift of
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
