          %h2#references References
          %p
            The concept of
            = succeed "-bordism" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi U
                    %mo ,
                    %mi fr
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (U,fr)
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/e-invariant"} e-invariant
            originates with:
          %ul
            %li#ConnerFloyd66
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Pierre+Conner"}> Pierre Conner
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Edwin+Floyd"} Edwin Floyd
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/The+Relation+of+Cobordism+to+K-Theories"} The Relation of Cobordism to K-Theories
                %strong 28
                Springer 1966 (
                %a{:href => "https://link.springer.com/book/10.1007/BFb0071091"}> doi:10.1007/BFb0071091
                ,
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.ams.org/mathscinet-getitem?mr=216511"} MR216511
            %li#ConnerSmith69
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Pierre+Conner"}> Pierre Conner
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Larry+Smith"} Larry Smith
                = succeed "," do
                  %em On the complex bordism of finite complexes
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.numdam.org/item/?id=PMIHES_1969__37__117_0"} numdam:PMIHES_1969__37__117_0
          %p
            Analogous discussion for
            = succeed "-bordism" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/MO"} MO
            = succeed "-boundaries:" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/MSO"} MSO
          %ul
            %li
              G. E. Mitchell,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Bordism of Manifolds with Oriented Boundaries
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.2307/2040234"} doi:10.2307/2040234
          %p
            Analogous discussion for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/MOFr"} MOFr
            is in
          %ul
            %li#Stong68
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Robert+Stong"}> Robert Stong
              , p. 102 of:
              = succeed "," do
                %em Notes on Cobordism theory
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "http://pi.math.virginia.edu/StongConf/Stongbookcontents.pdf"} toc pdf
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "http://press.princeton.edu/titles/6465.html"} ISBN:9780691649016
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://www.maths.ed.ac.uk/~v1ranick/papers/stongcob.pdf"} pdf
          %p See also
          %ul
            %li#Smith71
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Larry+Smith"}> Larry Smith
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em On characteristic numbers of almost complex manifolds with framed boundaries
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0040-9383(71)90008-5"} doi:10.1016/0040-9383(71)90008-5
          %p
            Generalization to
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/manifolds+with+corners"} manifolds with corners
            and relation to the
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/f-invariant"} f-invariant
          %ul
            %li
              Gerd Laures,
              = succeed "," do
                %em On cobordism of manifolds with corners
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1090/S0002-9947-00-02676-3"} doi:10.1090/S0002-9947-00-02676-3
